        "text": "Assignment 6a: Use the definition above to manipulate vertecies and make a similar effect as done with manipulating edges.\r\n\r\nC- Manipulating Vertecies:\r\n\r\nZ direction:\r\n\r\n1- Move each of the 4 vertecies of each panel, with different values, in the Z direction.\r\n\r\n2- Make \"4Point Surface\" from the moved points.\r\n\r\n\r\nNormal to surface:\r\n\r\n3- Repeat the same steps (1) & (2) but now moving the points Normal to surface.\r\n\r\nHINT: EACH of the 4 POINTS of EACH SURFACE has a UNIQUE NORMAL VECTOR!",
